WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Test 4. This is the IELTS listening test.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You will hear a number of different recordings

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
and you will have a chance to check your work.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
All the recordings will be played once only.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The test is in four parts.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
At the end of the test you will be given 10 minutes

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
to transfer your answers to the answer sheet.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Now turn to part 1.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Part 1. You will hear a man phoning to enquire

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.000
about a cleaning service for his apartment.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
First you have some time to look at questions 1 to 5.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Now listen carefully and answer questions 1 to 5.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Hello, Easy Life Cleaning Services, Jacinta speaking.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Oh, hello. I'm looking for a cleaning service for my apartment.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Do you do domestic cleaning?

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Sure.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Well, it's just a one-bedroom flat.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Do you have a basic cleaning package?

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Yes. For a one-bedroom flat,

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.000
we're probably looking at about two hours for a clean,

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.000
so we'd do a thorough clean of all surfaces in each room

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.000
and polish them where necessary.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Does your apartment have carpets?

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.000
No, I don't have any, but the floor would need cleaning.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Of course, we'd do that in every room

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.000
and we'd do a thorough clean of the kitchen and bathroom.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.000
OK.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Then we have some additional services,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.000
which you can request if you want.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.000
So, for example, we can clean your oven for you every week.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Actually, I hardly ever use that, but can you do the fridge?

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Sure. Would you like that done every week?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Yes, definitely.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.000
And would ironing clothes be an additional service you can do?

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Yes, of course.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.000
It wouldn't be much, just my shirts for work that week.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.000
That's fine.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.000
And we could also clean your microwave if you want.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:37.000
No, I wipe that out pretty regularly, so there's no need for that.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.000
We also offer additional services

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.000
that you might want a bit less often, say every month.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.000
So, for example,

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.000
if the inside of your windows need cleaning, we could do that.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.000
Yes, that'd be good.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.000
I'm on the 15th floor,

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.000
so the outside gets done regularly by specialists,

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.000
but the inside does get a bit grubby.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.000
And we could arrange for your curtains to get cleaned if necessary.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.000
No, they're OK.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.000
But would you be able to do something about the balcony?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.000
It's quite small and I don't use it much,

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.000
but it could do with a wash every month or so.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.000
Yes, we can get the pressure washer onto that.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.000
Before you hear the rest of the conversation,

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:21.000
you have some time to look at questions 6 to 10.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:49.000
Now listen and answer questions 6 to 10.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.000
Now, if you're interested,

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:58.000
we do offer some other possibilities to do with general maintenance.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.000
For example, if you have a problem with water

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.000
and you need a plumber in a hurry,

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.000
we can put you in touch with a reliable one

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.000
who can come out straight away.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.000
And the same thing if you need an electrician.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.000
And the same thing if you need an electrician.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.000
Right, that's good to know.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.000
I've only just moved here,

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.000
so I don't have any of those sorts of contacts.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.000
And I don't know if this is of interest to you,

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:27.000
but we also offer a special vacuum cleaning system

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.000
which can improve the indoor air quality of your home

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.000
by capturing up to 99% of all the dust in the air.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.000
So if you're troubled by allergies, this can make a big difference.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.000
Right. In fact, I don't have that sort of problem,

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.000
but I'll bear it in mind.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:46.000
Now, can you tell me a bit about your cleaning staff?

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.000
Of course.

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.000
So all our cleaners are very carefully selected.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.000
When they apply to us,

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.000
they have to undergo a security check with the police

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.000
to make sure they don't have any sort of criminal background.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.000
And of course, they have to provide references as well.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.000
Then if we think they might be suitable for the job,

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.000
we give them training for it.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.000
That lasts for two weeks, so it's very thorough,

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.000
and at the end of it, they have a test.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.000
If they pass that, we take them on,

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.000
but we monitor them very carefully.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:21.000
We ask all our clients to complete a review of their performance

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.000
after every visit and to email it to us

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.000
so we can pick up any problems straightaway and deal with them.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.000
OK. Well, that all sounds good.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.000
And will I always have the same cleaner?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.000
Yes. We do our best to organise it that way

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.000
and we usually manage it.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.000
Good. That's fine.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.000
Right, so I'd like to go ahead and...

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.000
That is the end of Part 1.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:53.000
You now have half a minute to check your answers to Part 1.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.000
Thank you.

